Description: Kavis small tools — task manager, calculator, emoji
 One binary, three tools (madde 7): `kavis-tools tasks` process list
 (CPU/RAM/disk, termination), `kavis-tools calc` calculator,
 `kavis-tools emoji` emoji picker.
 .
 Written in Vala; the texts come from the docs/kavis-arayuz-metinleri.md
 tables, the shared startup and text table are taken from kavis-common
 at build time.
